  "reasoning": "The defendant was operating a construction vehicle and, due to negligence, struck and killed a pedestrian. This conduct constitutes a traffic accident resulting in death, which under Chinese criminal law is charged as 交通肇事罪. None of the other listed charge labels (容留他人吸毒, 非国家工作人员受贿, 失火, 诈骗) apply to the facts.",
